 f_{i,s}(x)=a{\rm Tr}^{n}_{m}(bx^{2^i+1})+a^q {\rm Tr}^{n}_{m}(cx^{2^s+1}),~\text{where~} a\in \mathbb{F}_{2^n}~such~that~ a+a^q\neq 0,~n=2m~\text{is a positive integer}.
