Considering the conservations of the energy, angular momentum, and parity in the particle emission processes, the reaction channels of the first particle emission are listed as follows:
\begin{eqnarray}\label{eq13}
p+^7\textmd{Li}\rightarrow ^{8}\textmd{Be}^* \rightarrow \left\{
\begin{array}{l}
