The operators \eqref{eq:goaloperators} are constructed starting from $\sum_{\tau=1}^{t} \sigma_{\tau}^y\sigma_{\tau+1}^x \cdots \sigma_{\tau+k}^x \sigma_{\tau+k-1}^y$ (\emph{cf}. \eqref{eq:opk}) as follows. First we construct  
