The comparison of the backward curriculum algorithm and original REINFORCE is shown in figure 1. Until 1000 episodes, there is no conspicuous difference, but after that point, the backward curriculum algorithm clearly outperforms the original algorithm and solves the environment within 3000 episodes. 

