\end{figure}

We then implement SBINN. As the first step, we define all parameters to estimate (all the parameters in Table \ref{table:glucose-app} except $V_p$, $V_i$ and $V_g$, which are easily measurable) with an initial guess of zero using \verb|dde.Variable|, and create a list of all the variables to be used later (Fig.~\ref{code:sbinn}).

