\caption{\label{cyllinder_a} Mean relative velocity components between particle pairs in units of m~s$^{-1}$, as a function of vertical separation. The $Kn \sim 1$ data is shown on the top and the $Kn<1$ data on the bottom. Particles aggregate for separations of 4~mm or less in both data sets. }
