        Model & $\mu_\text{Man}$ & $\sigma_\text{Man}$ & $\mu_\text{Cru}$ & $\sigma_\text{Cru}$ & $\mu_\text{Mg}$ & $\sigma_\text{Mg}$ & $\chi^2$ & $f_\text{PB,Cru}$ & $f_\text{PB,Man}$ & $f_\text{PB,Cor}$ & $\left\langle f_\text{Dep,Mg}\right\rangle$ \\
