{Diamond_FCC_BSE_TDDFT_eq_vol_comparison_with_plasmon7.pdf}
\caption{ \small{The imaginary part of the dielectric function of diamond in the optical limit for various pressures using BSE (solid), TDDFT (dashed) and RPA (dotted). The inset plot shows the imaginary part of the inverse of the dielectric function including the plasmon peaks. In the inset, the curves obtained using TDDFT and RPA are scaled tenfold for the purpose of visualization. All the pressures indicated are in GPa. The densities for these pressures are $3.51$ g/cc, $5.50$ g/cc, $6.00$ g/cc and $7.00$ g/cc respectively.} } 
\label{Diamond_fcc_bse2}
