The difference in plasmon peak positions between TDDFT and Mermin+DFT is around $0.3-0.4$ Ha, which is larger than in the cubic diamond case. Further, the Mermin+DFT result has different structures near the peak parallel and perpendicular to $z$ compared to TDDFT in Fig. \ref{Lonsdaleite_242GPa_q_im_inv_eps}.  

