\caption{ \small{The imaginary part of the inverse of the dielectric function of bc8 at various pressures using BSE, TDDFT, RPA and the Kubo-Greenwood formula. The TDDFT, RPA, and KG are scaled fivefold and the finite-\emph{q} MA curve is scaled tenfold. All curves in the optical limit except the specially marked MA and TDDFT curves. } }  
