Various thin, flat plates are used to match the full-field cloak condition (\myeq{E2-perfect-field-cloak}), based on the ray optics four lens cloak in \cite{Choi-Cloak1-2014}.
The dispersion relation of the refractive indices for these plates are shown, for various values of $m$ and $L_c$, using \myeq{thinplate-phase-correct-2-m} in ambient air.
