We conduct experiments in different scenarios that attempt to emulate common mobility patterns: walking, driving a car, riding a train, and visiting a restaurant. All experiments were conducted in and around the city of Frankfurt am Main, Germany. For each scenario, we record a GPS trace that serves as the ground truth for our evaluation.%
