During each experiment, we carry the iPhone in flight mode to emit \gls{OF} advertisements and record the GPS trace using the \emph{SensorLog}~\cite{Thomas:SensorLog} application set to a \SI{2}{s} sampling interval.
The MacBook acts as the owner device that we use to download location reports after each experiment.
We did not carry any other Apple devices during an experiment, so we would not get additional reports.
