symbols are computed by numerical integration of Eq. (\ref{eq:equil})
for $\alpha=0$, $\alpha=0.2$ and $\alpha=0.4$ respectively. The continuous, dashed and dotted curves represent the solution given by Eq. (\ref{eq:muhapp}) for $\alpha=0$, $\alpha=0.2$ and $\alpha=0.4$ respectively. The approximation given by Eq. (\ref{eq:muhapp}) fits the results of the numerical solution.}
